00:28:22,080 --> 00:28:24,040
Hear it.

258
00:28:24,040 --> 00:28:26,560
Here's the hard truth.

259
00:28:26,560 --> 00:28:29,840
The audience of the Sermon on the Mount probably weren't like us.

260
00:28:29,840 --> 00:28:36,200
And what I mean by that is the audience of the sermon probably wouldn't have the means to drive to church.

