00:28:36,200 --> 00:28:41,860
The audience of the sermon wouldn't have a nice house to go home to.

262
00:28:41,860 --> 00:28:46,280
See, the audience of the sermon didn't have money in the bank account.

263
00:28:46,280 --> 00:28:53,580
The audience of the sermon were probably just like Jesus described in verse 3 of Matthew 5.

264
00:28:53,800 --> 00:28:57,880
God blesses those who are poor and realize their need for him.

265
00:28:57,880 --> 00:29:02,860
See, this is the reality for me, and this is the reality for a lot of us in here.

