00:29:02,860 --> 00:29:04,340
I'm a middle-class man.

267
00:29:04,340 --> 00:29:05,860
I live in Frederick County, Virginia.

268
00:29:05,860 --> 00:29:07,060
I have a good job.

269
00:29:07,060 --> 00:29:08,260
I have money in the bank.

270
00:29:08,260 --> 00:29:09,380
I drove here.

271
00:29:09,380 --> 00:29:11,340
I have a home and a family to go home to.

272
00:29:12,280 --> 00:29:21,820
See, part of the invitation to follow Jesus is for me to lay down those privileges and proximity to the world

273
00:29:21,820 --> 00:29:30,300
and prioritize proximity to God in which many ways, almost all ways, is upside down to the values of this world.

274
00:29:31,560 --> 00:29:32,980
I don't mean to be cranky.

