00:30:07,400 --> 00:30:10,840
It's wages are riches and honor and life.

284
00:30:10,840 --> 00:30:13,480
Come to God.

285
00:30:13,480 --> 00:30:15,360
Come close to God.

286
00:30:15,360 --> 00:30:16,640
Relational proximity.

